{"name": "Finset.sum_le_card", "statement": "lemma sum_le_card\n  {n} {f : α → ℕ}\n  (hf : ∀ a ∈ s, f a ≤ n)\n  : (∑ a ∈ s, f a) ≤ s.card * n", "module": "Tengoku.Foundation.Foundation.Vorspiel.Finset.Card", "source_path": "Foundation/Vorspiel/Finset/Card.lean", "library": "foundation", "source_url": "https://github.com/FormalizedFormalLogic/Foundation/blob/81810b9f22c49fbb32bd89c1e9737059d83a37e6/Foundation/Vorspiel/Finset/Card.lean", "toolchain": "leanprover/lean4:v4.34.0-rc2", "via": "equal"}
